/Title (The office rate rose nine basis points to 12.00% as the large newly delinquent loans described above more than offset two sizable loans that left delinquency, including one that resolved directly from foreclosure. Industrial increased one basis point to 1.14% on limited newly delinquent volume. Multifamily held at 7.69% as new 30-day delinquencies across several states were balanced by a similarly broad group of cures.)
